# Keep the build context small and never bake secrets or local state into the image.

**/node_modules
**/build
**/dist
**/coverage

# Secrets — must be injected at runtime, never copied in.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Local attachment storage (runtime data, not source).
server/uploads
**/uploads

# Local tooling / editor state
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store

# Python bridge and docs are not needed in the Node image.
backend
plan
memory
test_reports
tests
image

# Frontend is deployed separately (Vercel) and never belongs in this image.
frontend

*.md
!README.md
